# Bar providers: Bars.lua declares the interface, each Bars_<Name>.lua implements it,
# Bars_Select.lua binds the active ones onto ABA.Bars. Core.lua's ABA table must exist first
# but it registers nothing from the providers at load time, so Core loads before them.
Core.lua
Bars\Bars.lua
Bars\Bars_Blizzard.lua
Bars\Bars_Dominos.lua
Bars\Bars_Select.lua
Catcher.lua
Overlay.lua
Options.lua